## 11. Investigate failures without bypassing the gate

| Symptom | Next action |
| :--- | :--- |
| Danger does not run | Check the current PR event, workflow mapping, trusted checkout, and installed dependency. |
| Danger warns but the build passes | Expected for the source warning-only rules. Verify the separate mandatory blocking controls. |
| Bot receives an authorization error | Ask the integration owner to inspect binding, permissions, and actual Enterprise host/API endpoint. |
| NowSecure step is unknown or rejects an input | Confirm the exact approved step repository/version and its `step.yml`; do not guess aliases. |
| Wrong or stale security assessment | Stop progression and reconcile candidate/assessment identity. |
| Scan fails or a finding blocks release | Preserve evidence, fix the cause, and assess the corrected candidate through the approved workflow. |

