| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Android | Approved signing key, usually held in a keystore, and its protected access details. | A signed APK for the approved direct-distribution route, or a signed AAB for Google Play. |
| iOS | Correct Apple team, signing certificate/private key, provisioning configuration, and distribution method. | An exported device IPA suitable for the selected destination. |
| React Native | The Android setup **and** the iOS setup. | Separate Android and iOS packages. |

A Google Play service account or App Store Connect API key authorizes store operations. It does not replace the app's signing identity.

