<TabItem label="Google Play — AAB">

### A. Confirm store and credential readiness

Ask the authorized store/platform owner to confirm the existing app record, initial manual upload prerequisite, matching package name, available version code, approved Internal Testing track, tester eligibility, and service-account permissions.

The SOT binds the protected JSON location as `BITRISEIO_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON_KEY_URL`. The owner manages that credential; do not download or commit a raw key to complete this page.

### B. Review the source YAML

**Source reference — review the corrections below before use.** The supplied handbook includes:

