  "suffixes": [".js", ".jsx", ".ts", ".tsx"],
  "entry_files": ["App.tsx", "index.js"],
  "classifications": {}
}
```

Tests colocated under `src/`, `.d.ts` files, and tracked generated/vendor files must be listed by exact path with a reviewed classification reason. For the previous page's My Chicken App layout, populate the JSON `classifications` object as follows, then add the remaining actual test/declaration paths:

```json
