  "src/features/order/place-order.test.ts": "Jest test source; reviewed separately",
  "src/features/order/order-store.test.ts": "Jest integration test source; reviewed separately"
}
```

This block is the **value of `classifications`**, not a separate scope file. Do not classify production `place-order.ts` or `order-store.ts` out of measurement.

</TabItem>
<TabItem label="Android scope">

**File: `testing/coverage-scope.android.json`.** Example matching the previous page's Kotlin files under `app/src/main/java`; add existing Kotlin, variant, and other production roots as needed.

